Current repository inventory contains 240 branches total: `main` plus 239 non-main branches. One currently open Draft PR at audit time is #379 on `infra/305-netto-topology-rpi5-audit`; the repository is actively changing in parallel, so this inventory is only a baseline and must be re-resolved before cleanup.

